    {
      "id": "8724c2bc-5aec-497f-a541-ca0e46677796",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute o áudio e leia o nome do estilo em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "33e591e7-251f-48b0-9da2-97a49aa2ce85",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena, escute e leia o estilo em espanhol.</p><p><strong>Turismo rural.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>turismo rural.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5e36d27de47e4c798839d0109e632e62_b01-turismo-rural.png?Expires=1794099753&Signature=AVVFtopUap-2zHFBtCS6u~l8o7EHs8oaEcWq0RAwBIxjgES60PoX~BUJkmjaRJxMN~tbZB1SuvkpNXw8p1TiXhRFaSXzIDJeZ2R4XiBPiYNjJRR7-JEDcx0vwpuSgvKZ40L3FJFK-wcbu1SnKBt5ZQpEPRZUxE5J3V-WyzNE5vEgEuOVeeLuckntCNjz3SsYqwkVG9hZ~cWGep3ltRPlKoRHX5CcV3hwTLeH91wmU6NmqiU7yrCdHGWyKBck5Ie~IzK6Y~bsO2EJz07GQm4Kdlj5nCHO0MmHGsAfpOoTpjx29MlkpZgOWYVKJwg-Pa~998TX6t02XksyGgfw1o5OEg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5c7c874970984149919edf847926b9ee_b01-turismo-rural.mp3?Expires=1794099753&Signature=TUJn6rL3HV0wq0f6y1eg0HfoCo4Jf9gTlzif4KyEKz0eNSaC14CDF3aLmQLue48bcLONvb49d9-HYDvKNFpDVDhII84jqutm1jb2hEyFDjDsdS0DVT2dUwFDekLTo8YOKg3bbu0WXJt~18ioz-8FLZFkS71Lg0AtltRhM3z4nD5q4D3iwm12aQ1OAobWJ8HC0xzItVGScNZjAP8a9p8pObZMNEoVOlVYEbcXWj12w-DPB~vHoTLk5D~U6~QoUwlV5oHqbRvu~OrqS3ELvhmCtQLoAv-Pik6Dkx94lMqF3vkVD0h9bKegQ0MTkTyKfq9aEHl3KXzS~4VYUCvOY2kDYQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
