    {
      "id": "8454280b-1033-41da-b846-157fc94a0ad4",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe que o foco está no ritmo da experiência e no contato com o campo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a1087bcc-3db6-4d7c-bdfb-c7f533eae0fa",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Turismo rural</strong> aponta para viagens com ritmo mais calmo, contato com o campo e estadias fora do circuito urbano.</p><p>Ele costuma combinar com quem quer desacelerar, caminhar, descansar e ficar em lugares menores.</p><p>Exemplo em espanhol: <strong>Busco una experiencia tranquila, por eso me interesa el turismo rural.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d1e13a1c-9bca-466f-8420-c56ee2dd70ba",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute o áudio e leia o nome do estilo em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "95c6ae5a-128a-40e6-9881-54d94f5ed7d2",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena, escute e leia o estilo em espanhol.</p><p><strong>Ecoturismo.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>ecoturismo.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5e932ed5ea2644fda366fcd45fc72ecb_b03-ecoturismo.png?Expires=1794099753&Signature=ZA3LEjRL25afUFNfFqniwF8vYrhIkGiTYz7PHcgxkr9iRY~UyZ35NCJdvXj4RObABKqRWYOm9AFMQWQDZNKqorw48Cxzmew5E3oAxcOO5g6l0BNjD550ycr1V7Lv9M7~TTtCY1MaIOW94wXPnLabJ1nqdNTurkmiCuSUxj0DL4RgXG60LqSHQfT5sNOyALwhbVeEi4z2QlqMfWTWkPXTPvFrdZRoB1S6fyEI~-3Kfl~8uZwgQEkqn04PpteGJD26GR2yvyEnWbuFH-jwzN2ezxr0TXa4mBgkN3KEzazEEvFTlvYa-2lPH35WJdT0NBHb7k3H~tDKtN9W55Xaqjml9Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4c095a96859b48aa84201a2ad8bf59ae_b03-ecoturismo.mp3?Expires=1794099753&Signature=uBvMGv95tfIbV-5ovikBjIFfvYmavb088sV0QwmzhaAeLM37QaVAWL5pS2EAhUmUSCCSg70BYKdnwdv4HoXi4n9XZbSV95R7ojzzNKZv~H8ImXcngTckXVqgRIbi~ivoHr6HlM7vDVS5K0bXG2f8jyaLhLf0cEvebuEZW3s9mC6iGPca6ij4llG3zX8apTg62Loa9I8GCyOyC8W4R3l~RD7vVSs6GTPM9r0tpo~HQSK-x04jl6-17FwfirYDlGtdR6bQXGsyb3oD5E-64NpD-yIw02BOdrZOfC6f9WMX0txrTF~~j5B7gmTsBbdbawvYCMFpTaz5VaCiD9~osOAYUw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
