    {
      "id": "e80ad3f7-4b81-46d2-a20c-2f7483e4f279",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe que a palavra não significa apenas estar na natureza.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "69d07556-bd54-4433-92e4-7e5eb8a8670f",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Ecoturismo</strong> não é apenas viajar para a natureza.</p><p>A ideia central é reduzir impacto, respeitar o ambiente e valorizar conservação ou educação ambiental.</p><p>Exemplo em espanhol: <strong>Nos interesa el ecoturismo porque queremos viajar con menos impacto.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5f381469-4fb9-4cf7-9dab-ba86d185e5c4",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute o áudio e leia o nome do estilo em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "7675c7a0-f61c-4d28-ad60-e1ba19682a2d",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena, escute e leia o estilo em espanhol.</p><p><strong>Turismo cultural.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>turismo cultural.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/08d64e0cc8f6474690b9871d592f9205_b05-turismo-cultural.png?Expires=1794099753&Signature=QaXvLUA~XY4EhnbCHs72cMaYV5NmFnDumpFyo-1bVis~Wigw7MBWiKUT03rP9YkF6CFbOUPfl1jRngnhvPgJx8HSSANU-pFmubEy7wOGQg1ruQQnEeyV1HamRyERsS44xXLLbIvqQ6v4Gyv7M3kaQ6ekHJebnm6VHnTHAal9ascbqOqXOO0KW4RHnSQ39dHf9zwxgE4vwd7gftd8ydifqlrsF0ckQ47Ll~9hvYEvjh6b6RZfE-6exrRhQzxkNtvODm~O6un8L2CtGtE3ygS6Hj6KewNtc7Syja5ejt1RCqc7-wMEbjHJ7BBPrpxV7LuO9RMcTUWMCbDfkz59zGRBYg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/65dcf05bf5fe409aa174960948e44257_b05-turismo-cultural.mp3?Expires=1794099753&Signature=w9MGWAhN79vLUerfj9LAuMIPkvwogm4a90yc5mLsHVioQQBgVr-eBecOvtIzQ3mKy5wwhgceVpF6aROYEsHLwrH7tnWr3atM8WqPaV8Js-xGp8Z6ofk9wunrxeHxFeO7ITgeEsbqT5A3K-9JQCQC6SORZqVM8pCMKmzUSyxrebWqbqzlnkX8-4v8f6Ap5o7eHIbbPW6jCK-1g6~ktWp9Qu7DVf3DnulIMsUNXz2a7yBvHyAFD7pMzxV~Z8ON33Bkntkn9NQuqKz79UuZr1lRnbUNPEmQwdZU0rULqmyRDS6JRzqQ13vAgOzlOWCN-BbBs4T5hBCacGY-0xdZlhjxaQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
